{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24241","headline":"晓上天津桥闲望偶逢卢郎中张员外携酒同倾 · 白居易","name":"晓上天津桥闲望偶逢卢郎中张员外携酒同倾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上阳宫里晓钟後，天津桥头残月前。\n空阔境疑非下界，飘颻身似在寥天。\n星河隐映初生日，楼阁葱茏半出烟。\n此处相逢倾一醆，始知地上有神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}